    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Zeynab Wandati is a seasoned journalist with a passion for science journalism, sustainability, and multimedia storytelling. Boasting a robust career in broadcast journalism since 2010, Zeynab embarked on a transformative journey by joining the Master of Arts in Digital Journalism (MADJ) programme at Aga Khan University's Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC).",
